From 85489878725aca43c7b309ffba6d0823953312ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 09:22:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Security hardening: fix authorization, XSS, input validation,
 error leaking across all layers

Flask server.py:
- Add @require_admin() to update_user() to prevent privilege escalation
- Remove /api/products and /api/settings from PUBLIC_ROUTES (require auth)
- Add financial amount validation on expenses, stock, points, supplier invoices
- Replace all 150+ str(e) error responses with generic Arabic messages

Frontend app.js:
- Add escHTML() to 12+ innerHTML assignments (categories, user names, variants, cost rows)
- Validate data:URL format before injecting supplier file data into iframe/img
- Escape tenant slug, plan, owner_name in super admin dashboard

Electron server.js:
- Remove /api/products and /api/settings from PUBLIC_ROUTES

Routes (Express):
- Add admin authorization check to PUT /api/users/:user_id
- Replace all 150+ e.message/err.message error responses with generic messages
  across usersProductsInvoices.js, tablesCouponsBackups.js,
  stockTransfersSubscriptionsSync.js, adminDashboardXbrlShifts.js

https://claude.ai/code/session_01GiK3QgqPcWz2d1kmw1VUkv
